        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Powerful models exclude solo session discount",
        "summary": "The shared common package now defines `soloDiscountExcludedModelIds` on the Freebuff Freebucks wire type to identify Powerful models that do not receive the solo-session discount. A new `freebucksSoloDiscountFor` utility determines the discount for a model by checking if it belongs to the 'powerful' section or is explicitly listed in the excluded IDs. This utility replaces direct `soloDiscount` subtraction in `freebucksRowPrice` and `getFreebuffModelMeter` to ensure Powerful rows are charged in full while other rows retain the discount.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "The diff adds `freebucksSoloDiscountFor` to `common/src/util/freebuff-price-order.ts` which returns 0 when the section is 'powerful' or the model is in `soloDiscountExcludedModelIds`, and `common/src/types/freebuff-session.ts` adds `soloDiscountExcludedModelIds` to `FreebuffFreebucksInfo`.",
        "userVisible": true,
        "confidence": "medium",
        "unknowns": "The specific models designated as Powerful by the server are not listed in this diff, only the exclusion mechanism and picker section rule are defined.",
