        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff now identifies specific high-tier AI models that do not get the reduced price when you start a session alone. Previously, this discount applied broadly to solo sessions, but the system now explicitly excludes these more powerful models so they are charged at their full rate. This affects developers using the free tier who rely on these top-tier models, as their cost will no longer be lowered by the solo-session benefit. You will notice that starting a session with one of these specific models will deduct the full standard price from your credits instead of a discounted amount.",
        "at": "2026-11-10T00:20:58.245Z",
