        "What the Web and Cloud sidebars say about an account's country, from the session GET (docs/freebuff-account-hub.md).",
        "The \"VPN detected\" / \"Proxy detected\" banner, or null for no banner.",
        "A paying account is never sent to verify (operator, 2026-10-01).",
        "The exit's country: a full-access one means verifying from a direct line can unlock full access. Elsewhere there is nothing to unlock.",
